{"adapters":[{"kind":"local","display_name":"Local relay","display_icon_data_uri":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","doc":"The machine's own relay, built in: `local-loopback` serves every exposed port to this machine alone, `local-every-interface` serves public ports to any machine that reaches it. Where each listens is never a setting.","settings_schema":{"title":"LocalRelayInstanceSettings","description":"A local relay instance's settings. Its bind address is never one.","type":"object","properties":{"port":{"description":"The port the listener takes for QUIC and HTTP alike; absent, the listener's own default (4443 at loopback, 4445 at every interface).","default":null,"type":["integer","null"],"format":"uint16","minimum":0.0}},"additionalProperties":false}},{"kind":"cloudflare","display_name":"Cloudflare","display_icon_data_uri":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","doc":"A relay Cloudflare provisioned, dialed at its publish-and-subscribe URL, which carries its token and is kept whole as a secret. Serves public ports, at the relay's top level.","settings_schema":{"title":"CloudflareRelayInstanceSettings","description":"A Cloudflare relay instance's settings.","type":"object","required":["relay_url"],"properties":{"relay_url":{"description":"The relay's publish-and-subscribe URL as Cloudflare returns it, `https://draft-16.cloudflare.mediaoverquic.com/<token>`; its token rides the path, so the whole URL is a secret.","writeOnly":true,"type":"string"}},"additionalProperties":false}},{"kind":"moqpro","display_name":"moq.pro","display_icon_data_uri":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","doc":"A moq.pro project, dialed at its path on moq.pro's relays with a token signed by the project's key, which is kept as a secret. Serves public ports, under the project.","settings_schema":{"title":"MoqProRelayInstanceSettings","description":"A moq.pro relay instance's settings.","type":"object","required":["project_id","signing_key"],"properties":{"project_id":{"description":"The project's id as moq.pro names it: the root every token is minted under and the path the relay is dialed at.","type":"string"},"relay_url":{"description":"The relays the project is served at; absent, `https://cdn.moq.dev`.","default":null,"type":["string","null"]},"signing_key":{"description":"The project's signing key, the JWK moq.pro gave for it, as JSON or base64url JSON. It mints read and write for every broadcast of the project.","writeOnly":true,"type":"string"}},"additionalProperties":false}},{"kind":"test-secret-holder","display_name":"Secret-holding test relay","display_icon_data_uri":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAxIDEiPjxyZWN0Lz48L3N2Zz4=","doc":"A test build's relay whose settings hold a secret; it joins nothing.","settings_schema":{"title":"SecretHoldingTestRelaySettings","description":"A secret-holding instance's settings.","type":"object","required":["token"],"properties":{"label":{"default":null,"type":["string","null"]},"token":{"description":"The secret the tests look for everywhere it must not be.","writeOnly":true,"type":"string"}},"additionalProperties":false}}]}